{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3084","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3084/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3084/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3084/events","html_url":"https://github.com/pallets/click/issues/3084","id":3448472929,"node_id":"I_kwDOASN_zM7Ni4Vh","number":3084,"title":"Bug: Optional value not optional anymore","user":{"login":"axelbringenberg","id":117212162,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvyEAg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117212162?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/axelbringenberg","html_url":"https://github.com/axelbringenberg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axelbringenberg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axelbringenberg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axelbringenberg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axelbringenberg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axelbringenberg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axelbringenberg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axelbringenberg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axelbringenberg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/axelbringenberg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":94769817,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NDc2OTgxNw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-09-24T09:09:09Z","updated_at":"2025-12-05T00:22:06Z","closed_at":"2025-11-20T03:50:23Z","author_association":"NONE","type":{"id":2218506,"node_id":"IT_kwDOAP-P2c4AIdoK","name":"Bug","description":"An unexpected problem or behavior","color":"red","created_at":"2024-01-25T17:16:44Z","updated_at":"2024-07-26T10:37:51Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Outline\n\nAs stated in [official documentation](https://click.palletsprojects.com/en/stable/options/#optional-value): \n> Setting `is_flag=False, flag_value=value` tells Click that the option can still be passed a value, but if only the flag is given, the value will be `flag_value`.\n\nSince 8.3.0 this doesn't work anymore, instead `SystemExit` with \"Error: Option '--xyz' requires an argument.\" is thrown.\n\n### Replication of bug\n\nExample taken from documentation:\n```python\n@click.command()\n@click.option(\"--name\", is_flag=False, flag_value=\"Flag\", default=\"Default\")\ndef hello(name):\n    click.echo(f\"Hello, {name}!\")\n```\n\n```shell\n$ hello --name\nError: Option '--name' requires an argument.\n```\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe code example above should work as\n```shell\n$ hello --name\nHello, Flag!\n```\n\nIt's not even working in the generated documentation anymore: while [documentation up to Sep, 10th](https://web.archive.org/web/20250910222023/https://click.palletsprojects.com/en/stable/options/#optional-value) shows the expected and correct behavior, [current documentation](https://click.palletsprojects.com/en/stable/options/#optional-value) demonstrates the bug.\n\n- Python version: 3.11\n- Click version: 8.3.0\n","closed_by":{"login":"Rowlando13","id":67291205,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3MjkxMjA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67291205?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rowlando13","html_url":"https://github.com/Rowlando13","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rowlando13/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rowlando13/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rowlando13/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rowlando13/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rowlando13/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rowlando13/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rowlando13/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rowlando13/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rowlando13/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3084/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":14,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pallets/click/issues/3084/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}